        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Output.Prompt</assignToReference>
            <operator>Add</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>* If {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField} is blank skip this section entirely, do not include the section header either.  If {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField} is blank absolutely nothing should be displayed. DO NOT MAKEUP ANY INFORMATION. 
6. Record History
The most recently updated field is {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField}, the old value is {!mostRecentUpdateOldValue}, the new value is {!mostRecentUpdateNewValue}, and it was updated by {!mostRecentUpdateUsername} on {!mostRecentUpdateDate}. Use the account history provided to create similar summary of all history items highlighting the Changed Field, New Value, Old Value, User name, and Created date.
If {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField} is not blank include data on the filed update: Changed Field is {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField}, Old Value is {!mostRecentUpdateOldValue}, New Value is {!mostRecentUpdateNewValue}, User is {!mostRecentUpdateUsername}, and Update Date is {!mostRecentUpdateDate}.
If {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField2} is not blank include data on the filed update: Changed Field is {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField2}, Old Value is {!mostRecentUpdateOldValue2}, New Value is{!mostRecentUpdateNewValue2}, and Update Date is{!mostRecentUpdateDate2}.
If {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField3} is not blank include data on the filed update: Changed Field is {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField3}, Old Value is {!mostRecentUpdateOldValue3}, New Value is{!mostRecentUpdateNewValue3}, and Update Date is{!mostRecentUpdateDate3}.
If {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField4} is not blank include data on the filed update: Changed Field is {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField4}, Old Value is {!mostRecentUpdateOldValue4}, New Value is{!mostRecentUpdateNewValue4}, and Update Date is{!mostRecentUpdateDate4}.
If {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField5} is not blank include data on the filed update: Changed Field is {!mostRecentlyUpdatedField5}, Old Value is {!mostRecentUpdateOldValue5}, New Value is{!mostRecentUpdateNewValue5}, and Update Date is{!mostRecentUpdateDate5}.

Do not leave out any field updates if they have been filled in with values that are not blank.

Add a relevant emoji at the start of this section.
Use clear, concise, and straightforward language using the active voice.
Do not add any assumptions - only reflect the data from the snapshot.
</stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
    </assignments>
